    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a> for writing with <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec.multipart\"><code>Part</code></a>. This can be useful\non the server side to write a <code>Flux&lt;Part&gt;</code> received from a client to\nsome remote service.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../HttpMessageWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>HttpMessageWriter</code></a> 用于使用 <a href=\"Part.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec.multipart\"><code>Part</code></a> 进行写入。这在服务器端很有用，可以将从客户端接收的 <code>Flux&lt;Part&gt;</code> 写入到某个远程服务。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given object type is supported by this writer.",
