      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>elementType</code> - the type of objects in the stream which must have been\npreviously checked via <a href=\"../HttpMessageWriter.html#canWrite(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.canWrite(ResolvableType, MediaType)</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>elementType</code> - 流中对象的类型，该类型必须已通过 <a href=\"../HttpMessageWriter.html#canWrite(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>HttpMessageWriter.canWrite(ResolvableType, MediaType)</code></a> 预先检查。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mediaType</code> - the media type for the write (possibly <code>null</code>)",
